              "content": "=You are an expert business analyst. Below is monthly operational KPI data for 2026.\n\nAnalyze the data and generate a professional executive report in clean HTML using <h2>, <h3>, <p>, <ul>, <li>, <strong> and <hr> tags. Do not use Markdown.\n\nThe report must include:\n1. Executive Summary (3-4 sentences overview of the year)\n2. Top Performing Months (best 3 months and why)\n3. Critical Issues Detected (worst months, anomalies, red flags)\n4. KPI Trends Analysis (Revenue vs Target, Orders, Customer Satisfaction, On-Time Delivery)\n5. Actionable Recommendations (3-5 concrete actions based on the data)\n\nKPI Data:\n{{ $json.data.map(row => Object.entries(row).map(([k,v]) => k + ': ' + v).join(' | ')).join('\\n') }}"
